{"id":"C1-L053","title":"Pseudo-cleft sentences — introduction","cefr":"C1","level":"C1","unit":"C1-U03","focus":"Pseudo-cleft sentences — introdução","targets":{"grammar":"Pseudo-cleft sentences — introdução","pron":"Expressividade","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["field linguist","language documentation","community dictionary","endangered language","language archive","elder interview","reading book","literacy project","field recording","writing system","language revival","lexical entry","grammar sketch","fieldwork notebook","language survey","bilingual school","heritage speaker","speech community","language policy","linguistic research","phonetic transcription","curiosity-driven"],"field":"Pesquisa","genre":"Biografia","skill":"Fala","words_min":22},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 53 · Pseudo-cleft sentences — introduction","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Pseudo-cleft sentences — introdução.","**Pronúncia:** Expressividade.","**22 palavras novas** (pesquisa).","**Texto do dia:** biografia."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (C1):** eu consigo usar pseudo-clivadas (What I need is…, All I want is…, The reason why… is…) para dar ênfase numa biografia."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["","Esta aula treina **responder em frases completas (IELTS Speaking, TOEFL Speaking)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["field linguist","linguista de campo"],["language documentation","documentação de língua"],["community dictionary","dicionário comunitário"],["endangered language","língua ameaçada"],["language archive","arquivo de línguas"],["elder interview","entrevista com anciões"],["reading book","livro de leitura"],["literacy project","projeto de alfabetização"],["field recording","gravação de campo"],["writing system","sistema de escrita"],["language revival","revitalização de língua"],["lexical entry","verbete lexical"],["grammar sketch","esboço gramatical"],["fieldwork notebook","caderno de campo"],["language survey","levantamento linguístico"],["bilingual school","escola bilíngue"],["heritage speaker","falante de herança"],["speech community","comunidade de fala"],["language policy","política linguística"],["linguistic research","pesquisa linguística"],["phonetic transcription","transcrição fonética"],["curiosity-driven","movido pela curiosidade"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A biography","blocks":[{"type":"bio","name":"Prof. Ayla Moreira (fictional)","paras":["Ayla Moreira, a fictional linguist, has always known **what she wanted**: **What drove her was curiosity.** **All she needed was** a library and a notebook. **What surprised her teachers was** her patience with fieldwork.","**The reason why** she moved abroad **was that** no one studied her language. **What she did next was** to create the first dictionary of her community. **What matters most to her is** that children can read it."],"years":"b. 1970","facts":[["Job","linguista"],["Famous for","primeiro dicionário da comunidade"],["Motto","curiosidade primeiro"]],"gloss":[["fieldwork","trabalho de campo"],["patience","paciência"],["community","comunidade"],["dictionary","dicionário"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Ayla was driven by curiosity.","ans":"T","why":"What drove her was curiosity."},{"q":"She moved abroad because many studied her language.","ans":"F","why":"no one studied."},{"q":"She created a dictionary for her community.","ans":"T","why":"first dictionary."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“patience” = ?","opts":["paciência","paciente","passagem"],"ans":0,"why":"patience."},{"q":"“community” = ?","opts":["comunidade","comunicação","comum"],"ans":0,"why":"community."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Pseudo-clivadas (wh-clefts)","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Estrutura","Exemplo"],"rows":[["What + sujeito + verbo + is/was…","**What drove her was curiosity.**"],["All + sujeito + verbo + is/was…","**All she needed was a notebook.**"],["The reason why… is/was (that)…","**The reason why she left was that no one studied it.**"],["What + sujeito + did + was + to + verbo","**What she did next was to create a dictionary.**"]],"cap":"Pseudo-clivadas (wh-clefts)"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"A pseudo-clivada **começa com what/all/the reason**, depois **is/was**. É muito usada para **destacar um fato** ou **dar uma conclusão**."},{"type":"box","kind":"warn","t":"Cuidado","body":"Depois de *was to* usa-se o **infinitivo**: *What she did was to write*."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"___ drove her was curiosity. (What)","a":"What","why":"wh-cleft."},{"s":"All she needed ___ a notebook. (was)","a":"was","why":"All … was."},{"s":"The reason why she left was ___ no one studied it. (that)","a":"that","why":"the reason why."},{"s":"What she did next was ___ create a dictionary. (to)","a":"to","why":"was to."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["field linguist","linguista de campo"],["language documentation","documentação de língua"],["community dictionary","dicionário comunitário"],["endangered language","língua ameaçada"],["native speaker","falante nativo"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["drove","Ayla","Moreira","What"],"ans":"What drove Ayla Moreira","pt":"O que movia Ayla Moreira?"},{"words":["move","abroad","Why","did","she"],"ans":"Why did she move abroad","pt":"Por que ela se mudou?"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"field linguist","pos":"word","pt":"linguista de campo","ex":"Field linguist.","expt":"Linguista de campo."},